-20 03:04:29','2026-05-20 03:04:29'),(9,'Descuento Especial','Descuento especial aplicado a cliente preferente.',0.00,'plantilla','descuento',0,1,1,9,'2026-06-02 15:33:16','2026-06-02 15:33:16');
